            <fieldText>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: Calibri;&quot;&gt;Solicitação de Fast Track&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: Calibri;&quot;&gt;Certifique-se que esta oportunidade preenche todos os requisitos, antes de solicitar o seu “FastTrack”.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: Calibri;&quot;&gt;Oportunidades elegíveis à categoria FastTrack:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: Calibri;&quot;&gt;1-) Fornecimentos complementares a uma venda já efetuada pela Agility (Produtos e/ou Serviços).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: Calibri;&quot;&gt;2-) Renovação de Produtos ou Serviços;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: Calibri;&quot;&gt;3-) Fornecimentos de Produtos e/ou Serviços básicos, rigidamente especificados pelo Cliente.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: Calibri;&quot;&gt;4-)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: Calibri;&quot;&gt;IMPORTANTE:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: Calibri;&quot;&gt;O&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: Calibri;&quot;&gt;mapeamento&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: Calibri;&quot;&gt;deve&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: Calibri;&quot;&gt;estar&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: Calibri;&quot;&gt;aprovado.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: Calibri;&quot;&gt;Se sua solicitação FastTrack for aprovada pelo PO, evoluirá automaticamente para a etapa de construção de proposta (PSL).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: Calibri;&quot;&gt;Importante: Uma oportunidade FastTrack não possibilita a confecção de um BluePrint pela Agility.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</fieldText>
